<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear that your recent inflight experience didn’t meet your expectations.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong>&nbsp;<br />
We’re committed to delivering an enjoyable in-flight experience to our customers and we know a clean aircraft cabin is an essential part of this. Our team always do their best to ensure the cabin is clean and tidy ahead of your flight.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If they have health concerns add:</strong></em><br />
<br />
<strong>Your health and safety is our highest priority</strong><br />
For more details about health advice when travelling with us please visit <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/travel-advice/your-health-inflight.html">Inflight health</a>.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
I want to assure you that I've passed your comments on to the relevant team for review.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>